<!-- BSU EngageBSU student organizations (engage.bridgew.edu) - manually maintained sitemap. Built 2026-09-23. 148 URLs. -->
<!--
  SCOPE
  Student Government Association (all 8 pages) plus the Established Student
  Organizations that have a public EngageBSU microsite (home and contact pages
  only). Department groups, department programs, club sports and the campus-wide
  /events and /groups directories are deliberately out of scope.

  HOW THIS LIST WAS BUILT, 2026-09-23
  The 93 groups in the "Established Student Organization" category were listed
  from the group directory, giving 92 distinct EngageBSU slugs. Each slug's
  /home/ and /contact-us/ pages were fetched and checked individually. 71 slugs
  have real pages; 21 do not and are excluded. Of those 21, 19 have no microsite
  and return the not-found page, 1 (WBIM) is members-only behind a login, and 1
  returned nothing. Every slug that has a home page also has a contact page.

  Page sizes at build time: home pages 1,591 to 4,233 characters, median 2,658.
  Contact pages 1,130 to 2,119, median 1,249. All server-rendered.

  MAINTAINER NOTES (all verified 2026-09-23)

  1. THIS SITE NEVER RETURNS 404. Every URL returns HTTP 200, including ones that
     do not exist, so status codes cannot validate a URL here. There are three
     things to watch for, all served as 200:
       - title exactly "EngageBSU"              = no such page under that slug
       - title exactly "Campus Home - EngageBSU" = no such page at top level
       - title exactly "StudentsCommunityPlatform" = members-only, login required
     A real page has a title ending in "| Bridgewater State University".
     Re-check this way, never by status code.

  2. Trailing slashes are required and inconsistent. /sga/contact-us/ works and
     /sga/contact-us silently returns the not-found page. Copy each URL exactly
     as written below. Do not add or remove a slash.

  3. SGA slugs do not match SGA page titles. /sga/events/ is titled "General
     Information", /sga/docs/ is "Agendas and Minutes", /sga/past-newsletters/
     is "Meeting Video Recordings". Do not infer meaning from those slugs.

  4. Group membership changes every year. Groups appear, fold, and build or
     abandon microsites. Re-run the directory listing and the per-slug check
     each term rather than assuming this list still holds.

  5. These pages carry student officer names and rosters. That is a deliberate
     decision recorded at build time, not an oversight. If it is revisited,
     the contact pages are the ones to drop first.

  6. robots.txt on this host disallows /upload/, /student_docs/, /downloads/,
     /mobile_ws/ and any URL containing ajax_widget_new. None appear below.

  7. No <lastmod>. The platform does not expose a page modification date, and
     inventing one would be worse than omitting it.
-->
